      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1728000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EXTRACTION & REPAIR ENGINE \u2014 bounded to 2 attempts",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EXTRACTION & REPAIR ENGINE \u2014 bounded to 2 attempts",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_03053585",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 525,
      "width": 492.99999999999994,
      "height": 146.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 782003,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1728000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deterministic Quality Linters (offline, zero-cost):\n \u2022 ears.analyse: event/state/ubiquitous arity & compound splitting\n \u2022 lexicon.scan: weak-word lexicon (rapidly, robust, seamless, etc.)\n \u2022 quantities: flags numbers not in source text (anti-hallucination)\n \u2022 provenance: checks quoted_source appears verbatim in input text\n\nBounded Repair Loop:\n \u2022 feeds back line-level defect & remedy to model; max 2 rounds\n \u2022 safe degraded fallback: preserves defects rather than inventing",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12.5,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deterministic Quality Linters (offline, zero-cost):\n \u2022 ears.analyse: event/state/ubiquitous arity & compound splitting\n \u2022 lexicon.scan: weak-word lexicon (rapidly, robust, seamless, etc.)\n \u2022 quantities: flags numbers not in source text (anti-hallucination)\n \u2022 provenance: checks quoted_source appears verbatim in input text\n\nBounded Repair Loop:\n \u2022 feeds back line-level defect & remedy to model; max 2 rounds\n \u2022 safe degraded fallback: preserves defects rather than inventing",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
