      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADVERSARIAL COMPLIANCE GROUNDING \u2014 3-point verification",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADVERSARIAL COMPLIANCE GROUNDING \u2014 3-point verification",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text_c55a6f53",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 675,
      "y": 525,
      "width": 485.74999999999994,
      "height": 211.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 163332,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1728000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hybrid Retrieval Engine:\n \u2022 dense BGE-small-en (512d) + BM25 keyword + cross-encoder rerank\n\nDeterministic 3-Point Grounding Check:\n 1. Clause exists in versioned DB (no hallucinated citations)\n 2. Quoted text matches clause substring verbatim\n 3. DeBERTa-v3-small-mnli evaluates semantic entailment\n\nConfidence Fusion & Tier Partitioning:\n \u2022 score = f(retrieval, NLI, quote) in [0, 1]\n \u2022 Tier 1: auto-confirmed (statutory obligation satisfied)\n \u2022 Tier 2: needs review -> routed to Gate 2 with reasoning\n \u2022 Regulatory Judge Agent: second opinion on review band (advisory)",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12.5,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hybrid Retrieval Engine:\n \u2022 dense BGE-small-en (512d) + BM25 keyword + cross-encoder rerank\n\nDeterministic 3-Point Grounding Check:\n 1. Clause exists in versioned DB (no hallucinated citations)\n 2. Quoted text matches clause substring verbatim\n 3. DeBERTa-v3-small-mnli evaluates semantic entailment\n\nConfidence Fusion & Tier Partitioning:\n \u2022 score = f(retrieval, NLI, quote) in [0, 1]\n \u2022 Tier 1: auto-confirmed (statutory obligation satisfied)\n \u2022 Tier 2: needs review -> routed to Gate 2 with reasoning\n \u2022 Regulatory Judge Agent: second opinion on review band (advisory)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
